# Build context of the root Dockerfile (docs/deployment.md). Everything the images need is source plus the lockfile;
# installed modules, build output, local secrets, uploads and agent worktrees never enter the context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
**/.env~
**/*.env~
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
.git
.github
.claude
infra/certs
infra/.smoke
var
third-party
*.log
**/*-findings*.json
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
